{
  "_comment": "Packages the C# launcher offers beyond manifest items and mods.json: the HD packs. A package is one row; its parts are the files it writes. Sizes are exact bytes, measured 2026-09-24: Reforged by HEAD on their R2 host, Faithful from its zip's own directory. A file on disk is matched to a package BY SIZE, which is how a patch-A from Reforged is told from one from Faithful or anybody else.",
  "_comment2": "needs: ids of packages or mods (mod:<file>) that must be on. parent: drawn indented under that package and needs it. conflicts: package ids that cannot be on with this one although they write different files. choices: variants of one package; Space steps through them.",
  "_comment3": "Faithful parts carry zip: the Drive zip STORES its patches, and Drive answers range requests, so one patch is fetched as the byte range [offset, offset + size) of the zip. crc32 is the zip's own check for that range.",

  "_comment4": "sha256 on a part is checked after the download. The login screen's patch is pinned to a commit, since the repo has no releases.",

  "dxvk": {
    "_why": "Added 2026-09-24 for Project Reforged, whose Turtle page asks for DXVK 2.7.1, or 2.5.3 as a fallback: the x32 d3d9.dll beside WoW.exe. It is not a mod in mods.json because it is not a line in dlls.txt; the game loads it by sitting beside the exe. One row, one choice per build. A build is recognised BY THE sha256 OF d3d9.dll, measured 2026-09-24: Turtle ships its own 2.7.1 build (a2cd68..., 4501518 bytes, in octow, clean-turtle and fresh-test), which is not stock 2.7.1 (00ecd4..., in octow - Copy and ravencraft). twow-hd has stock 2.5.3. A build with no url cannot be fetched and is offered only while its file is on the disk or set aside. A file no build knows is offered as the player's own. Switching sets the old file aside, never deletes it. The tarball sha256 came from a curl download and matched three downloads by the launcher; the release pages publish none.",
    "file": "d3d9.dll",
    "note": "draws the game through Vulkan",
    "advice": "Project Reforged asks for 2.7.1, or 2.5.3 as a fallback.",
    "builds": [
      { "name": "Turtle's", "note": "2.7.1, as Turtle ships it", "sha256": "a2cd6841e102f37189527c118ec416fa5071ac4d3120762973d9a0c6c5fd067e" },
      { "name": "2.7.1", "sha256": "00ecd422b3b12e9d3b309785f3f19431405389d80eb4a37018ebc63e2d87d900",
        "url": "https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk/releases/download/v2.7.1/dxvk-2.7.1.tar.gz", "size": 10310666,
        "archive_sha256": "d85ce7c79f57ecd765aaa1b9e7007cb875e6fde9f6d331df799bce73d513ce87", "extract": "dxvk-2.7.1/x32/d3d9.dll" },
      { "name": "2.5.3", "sha256": "3d6b529dc4f7f55639aad580e81b2939ab1489cdbb9f1550dce74e41656bbf5b",
        "url": "https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk/releases/download/v2.5.3/dxvk-2.5.3.tar.gz", "size": 9881540,
        "archive_sha256": "d8e6ef7d1168095165e1f8a98c7d5a4485b080467bb573d2a9ef3e3d79ea1eb8", "extract": "dxvk-2.5.3/x32/d3d9.dll" }
    ]
  },

  "sections": [
    {
      "_why": "paokkerkir/vanilla-autologin 3.0.2, tried on octow and kept by the owner on 2026-09-24. It adds its own GlueXML files and does not replace AccountLogin or CharacterSelect, so patch-V's changes to those screens still apply. Its GlueXML.toc drops OctoWoW's six locale files (login screen text for deDE, esES, ptBR, ruRU and zhCN, and the ruRU/zhCN font), so those login screens show English. It reads and writes Imports\\logins.txt through Nampower. The repo has no license; the launcher fetches the file from the author's repo and hosts nothing.",
      "title": "Login screen",
      "pack": "Login",
      "links": [
        { "name": "Their page", "note": "github.com/paokkerkir/vanilla-autologin", "url": "https://github.com/paokkerkir/vanilla-autologin" }
      ],
      "packages": [
        {
          "id": "autologin",
          "name": "Saved accounts",
          "note": "log in with one click, and order your characters",
          "needs": ["mod:nampower.dll"],
          "advice": "Passwords are kept in Imports\\logins.txt, as plain text unless WOW_ENCRYPTION_KEY is set.",
          "parts": [
            { "letter": "Y", "size": 12822, "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paokkerkir/vanilla-autologin/2665aeb14d9eaaa51f1532c7dc689c6a18b49a73/patch-Y.MPQ", "sha256": "fe7be1b6790b789b1bd47985590ca3062434c33da7d2e7f56a8fba996c7b3e0c" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
